<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/veryhot_post_sticky.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it] &nbsp;(Read 17160 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174" title="View the profile of Delheru">Delheru</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 151<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7662#msg7662"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7662#msg7662">History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> May 04, 2004, 02:52:32 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Originally was going to answer Codlugarthias question in the Top 5 thread, but ended up going off on tangents with contributions from irc until I realized it probably should get a thread of its own. Considering the huge gaps in it (not to mention probably misinformation), it would be fun to get corrections from people who actually were there and know &nbsp;(my guess of WoW creation date is that it was between June 1999 and early 2002 for example). <br /><br />Anyway threw a very rough timeline with information I can and will update myself (lots of those firsts are in our dkp with quite exact dates).<br /><br />Anyway Kinladar make this sticky for posteritys sake, and people post any corrections/additions you can think of. Lets try to keep it somewhat focused, so events conserning guilds or people not relevant in the &quot;top 10 guilds&quot; scene should not be posted, simply because the whole thing would get incredibly cluttered with information about 500 or so guilds :P<br /><br />Server Firsts will be in cursive.<br /><br /><br /><b>[27th April 1999 or so] &nbsp;RN opens</b><br /><i>[?] Feylin is the first level 50 &nbsp;(druid)</i><br />[?] Covenant of Peace formed. Lead by Rhyno, influentials include Dyvim, &nbsp;Mirax, Axine and lots of others.<br />[?] Legions of Rodcet Nife is formed and accomplishes... what? Who were key members or the leader for that matter? Feylin, Nails example members<br /><br />[October 1999] Brotherhood of Steel formed mostly by BatMUD players with Glayde as the leader. Most Ascent officers will be members at one point or another (Delheru, Honch, Reia, Vesi)<br />[?] Souls of Relevance formed. Corona, Tuvas, Mairi as influentials and Fulkson as leader.<br />[?] Covenant of Peace falls to internal disagreements mostly between Mirax and Axine<br />[?] Warlords of Wrath formed with Lachdonnan leading. The leads were to be passed on to later influentials such as Lliam, Emalith, Quintus, Grum and Foolra.<br />[?] Mirax leaves Rodcet Nife<br />[?] Something goes horribly wrong between Axine and Sinclaire (Vosh), and both are the types to hold a grudge<br />[?] Avatars of Discord forms, lead by Satao with Dyvim, Axine, Asian, Morghul, Malsheen, Ailennin, Nails, Kimmy, Armanthus, Lofwyr etc as fairly key figures<br />[?] Arcane legacy forms, Rhyno leads with Ghime, Zinf, Ryne etc as key figures<br />[?] Harbinger of storms forms as an &quot;less&quot; American guild with a lot of asians. Does planes etc. Lead by Valdraug with influentials like Sern, Gazloy and Liosliath &nbsp;(just thought the man deserved a mention for sure :P)<br />[?] Thelyn Amar forms, lead by Sinclaire (aka Vosh) with other influentials such as Vykdrago, Mirax, Celegrom and Xanatax<br /><br />[?] Highland Clan formed with Snakes leading and other (later to be) influentials including Thun, Rogosh, Lighting, Sysquella etc<br /><i>[June 1999] Sinclaire (Vosh) &lt;Thelyn Amar&gt; obtains the first Soulfire on Rodcet Nife</i><br />[?] Eastern Keep forms, lead by Carol with Jeet, Yohon etc as other influentials<br />[?] Guardians of the Malt Formed with Dajal leading. Other influentials include Fornza, Doraf, Vison, Hairen etc.<br /><br /><i>[?] First Nagafen kill - by a semi pickup raid run by... who?</i> <br /><i>[16th Oct, 1999] First Vox kill - mostly AoD/AL force lead by Dyvim</i><br />[?] Other significant guilds include Darkflame Knights, Brotherhood of Steel, Souls of Relevance etc etc<br />[?] Thelyn Amar disappears due to the political problems caused by the Axine - Sinclaire dispute<br />[?] Sinclaire rerolls as Vosh<br />[?] Rhyno retires?<br /><br />[?] Honch, Xanatax, Morbos etc form Exiled Legion to do planes outside the domination of AoD/AL<br /><i>[?] CT killed by AoD/AL</i><br />[?] Vosh joins Exiled Legion<br />[?] Plane of Hate opens<br /><i>[18th Dec, 1999] AoD/AL kills Innoruuk</i><br />[December 1999] Ancient Souls formed under the leadership of Dundamoor. Eelyen and Locz other influentials.<br />[January 2000] Ancient Souls leadership passes on to Eelyen<br />[?] 3 day PoFear camp by HoS/EL/someone(DK?) to get CT succeeds, AoD/AL furious<br />[?] Delheru and Reia join Exiled Legion (!)<br />[?] Massive arguments about &quot;farming&quot; of Plane of Fear, with Dyvim, Zinf as the main attackers and EK on the defensive.<br />[?] Exiled Legion kills Innoruuk<br />[?] Exiled Legion kills Cazic Thule<br />[?] HoS kills CT<br /><br />[?] HoS splits due to playtimes or whatever. What is now HoS is clearly dominated by asian players. Valdraug, Gazloy etc leading figures.<br />[?] Dol Amroth is formed by the Americans from HoS and the higher level players from Darkflame Knights, with Vyel, Nujai, Qadan, Filja as key figures originally.<br />[?] Darkflame Knights withdraw from the high end game.<br />[?] Exiled Legion kills Nagafen<br />[?] Dol Amroth kills Nagafen<br />[?] HoS kills Vox<br />[?] HoS kills Nagafen<br />[?] Sultania leads popular pick up raids to kill high end content. Huge conversation about official rotations and &quot;planar calendars&quot;.<br />[?] Sultanias revolution overrun by the AoD/AL steamroller at Nagafen.<br />[?] Brotherhood of Steel and Souls of Relevance Merge to form Altered Destiny. Corona, Glayde etc as significants.<br />[?] &nbsp;Ancient Souls goes somewhere in here<br />[?] Krolins guild? Fear and Disorder or something<br /><i>[?] Aegeis &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt; finishes the Fiery Avenger</i><br /><br /><br /><b>[31st March 2001: RUINS OF KUNARK RELEASED]</b><br /><br />[?] AL core of Zinf, Ryne, Moglit, Ghime, Strago(?) move to Veeshan to join FoH after being clearly ahead of the leveling curve on RN. Zinf delevels, but Ghime sells to Arktreod of AoD.<br />[?] Few EL and AoD groups race for content like Sebilis first.<br />[?] Asian retires<br />[?] Dyvims playtime reduces significantly.<br /><i>[?] Feylin and Arkmaru argue about who hit 60 first.</i><br />[?] Delheru, Dyvim, Nails fade away during the summer 2001<br /><i>[?] HoS kills Venril Sathir</i><br />[?] Fargus, Reeves, Aktar etc had their own guild thing going, definitely badly placed here.<br />[?] The new Ghime has leveled to 60 and starts his &quot;Ghime&#039;s club&quot; which does deep Sebilis with the first lvl 60s on the server.<br />[?] AoD/AL and EL are both in fairly bad shape, and during a Chardok raid decide to unite forces.<br />[?] Altered Destiny allies with Dragon Knights to take out Trakanon<br />[?] Lots of older AoD/AL/EL members return to the game<br /><i>[10th Sep, 2000] AD/DK kills Trakanon</i><br /><i>[10th Sep, 2000] MythMakers, Circle of Sol and friends lead by Fargus, Aktar and Reeves defeats Plane of Sky island 7</i><br />[?] AoD/AL/EL kills Trakanon<br />[?] The new Ghime joins AoD<br />[?] Delheru joins AoD<br />[?] AoD/AL/EL and AD/DK negotiate a rotation, but the terms favor the more hardcore AoD/AL/EL and soon the rotation turns in to their domination<br />[?] AoD/AL/EL kills Venril Sathir<br /><i>[?] AoD/AL/EL kills Silverwing</i><br />[?] EK kills Trakanon<br />[?] EK gets overrun by AoD/AL/EL in a race for Trakanon<br />[?] FA quests released &nbsp;(more on those elsewhere)<br />[?] Llew retires(?)<br /><br /><br /><b>[4th of December, 2000: SCARS OF VELIOUS RELEASED]</b><br /><br />[?] Guardians of the Malt is no more<br />[?] Valde Amicitia forms<br />[?] Nails vanishes<br /><i>[?] AoD/AL/EL kills Gorenaire</i><br /><i>[20th Dec, 2000] AoD/AL/EL kills Yelinak</i><br />[?] EL becoming more of a burden for the alliance. There is also AoD internal discord between factions lead by Delheru and Axine.<br />[?] DA kills Trakanon<br />[?] HoS kills Trakanon<br /><i>[?] AoD/AL/EL kills Klandicar &nbsp;</i> <br /><i>[17th Feb, 2001] AoD/AL/EL kills Zlandicar</i><br />[?] Guardians of the Malt disbands<br />[?] Valde Amicitia forms on the remains of GotM<br /><br />[?] EK kills Xygoz<br />[?] AoD/AL/EL clears VP<br />[14th March, 2001] Planes of Fear and Hate revamped<br /><i>[14th March, 2001] AoD/AL/EL all reforming and kill the new Cazic Thule and the new Innoruuk as &lt;Pirates of Velious&gt; &nbsp; </i> <br />[?] Exiled Legion guilddeleted by Honch<br />[?] Ascent formed with Honch, Delheru, Mairi, Difa and Sethric (Feylin) as officers, with other influentials including Xanatax, Thun, Reia and Braelyia<br />[?] Ascent introduces DKP (an &lt;Afterlife&gt; innovation) to Rodcet Nife<br />[?] Vosh retires<br />[?] EL reforms due to Honch allowing it, Nendarea the main influential<br />[?] Ascent remains allied with AoD/AL/EL, but starts equipping its own members clearly faster than AoD/AL/EL can do<br />[?] The infamous Jaja post of Ascent logs discussing leaving the alliance<br />[?] War begins between AoD/AL/EL and Ascent, with DF and EK siding with AoD/AL/EL<br />[?] Forsaken formed with Rogosh as leader<br /><br /><i>[?] EK kills Velketor, but fails to repeat</i><br /><i>[?] EK kills Dain, but fails to repeat</i><br /><br />[8th April, 2001] Ascent kills Klandicar<br />[11th April, 2001] Ascent kills Zlandicar<br /><i>[20th May, 2001] Ascent kills Telkorenar</i><br />[30th May, 2001] Ascent kills Cazic Thule<br />[31th May, 2001] Ascent - AoD/AL/EL relations at their tightest. There is a 5 hour standoff at Dain for the killing rights.<br /><br />[?] Dyvim leads a huge alliance of guilds in the first ever serious attempt at Tunare. Everyone invited except Ascent.<br /><br />[?] EK kills Cazic Thule<br />[4th May, 2001] Ascent kills Velketor<br />[4th May, 2001] Ascent kills Dain<br /><i>[27th May, 2001] AoD/AL/EL kills Vindicator</i><br /><i>[27th May, 2001] AoD/AL/EL kills Statue of RZ</i><br /><br />[4th June, 2001(?)] Carol causes EK scandal, lots of members leave (wtf happened here?)<br />[6th June, 2001] Echoes in Eternity formed around people that left EK. Jeet leads the guild.<br />[?] Ascent kills Cazic Thule<br />[7th June2001] Ascent kills Vindicator<br />[7th June, 2001] Ascent kills Statue of RZ<br /><i>[25th June, 2001] Ascent starts breaking in to North Wing of Temple of Veeshan with kills of Ikatiar and Eashen.</i><br />[26th June, 2001] Ascent kills Yelinak<br /><i>[28th June, 2001] Korban &lt;Ascent&gt; gets the first primal weapon on RN</i><br /><br />[?] AoD/AL/EL kills Yelinak<br /><i>[?] AoD/AL/EL kills Tormax</i><br /><i>[3rd July, 2001] Ascent kills the first ST warders</i><br />[?] HoS is no more<br />[?] AoD leads passed to Vyck (Vykdrago)<br />[?] Arirang formed, with influentials such as Nashira and Achiel<br />[?] AoD/AL/EL kill ST warders<br />[?] EK and Arirang ally due to similar playing times<br /><i>[?] EK/Arirang kill Dozekar</i><br /><i>[6th August, 2001] Ascent kills Aaryonar and pillages Temple of Veeshan</i><br />[?] Nails returns and joins Ascent<br /><i>[18th August, 2001] Ascent kills Vulak</i><br />[3rd Sep, 2001] AoD/AL/EL kills Vulak<br /><br />[?] AD and DK merge to form Dragon Force, with Corona leading and Glayde, Zretch etc as influentials<br />[28th August, 2001] Ascent kills Tormax<br />[?] AoD/AL/EL and Ascent relations cool down, with a lax rotation in place<br /><i>[13th Oct, 2001] Ascent does the Dain War for Sethric</i><br /><i>[14th Oct, 2001] AoD/AL/EL kills Ventani, releasing the Sleeper</i><br />[?] Ascent clashes against Arirang/EK, who farm Statue denying Ascent shots at AoW<br />[?] Carol ninjaloots Dozekar, EK/Arirang alliance dissolves<br />[?] AoD/AL/EL clashes with EK over Tormax (picture!)<br />[?] AoD leads passed to Bartox<br />[?] Carol retires (??)<br />[?] Fin De Cycle slowly fades away with Dol Amroth taking in most of their raiders.<br />[?] Highland Clan splits with significant portions joining Ascent<br />[?] Highland Clan remainers and Arctus Syndicus form Hegemony<br /><br />Warlords of Wrath formed... when?<br />Ancient Souls went down somewhere here?<br /><br /><br /><br /><b>[2nd of December, 2001: SHADOWS OF LUCLIN RELEASED]</b><br /><br />[December] Dol Amroth and Echoes in Eternity team up to take down Cazic Thule and an alliance is born<br /><i>[29th Dec, 2001] Ascent kills Xerkizh the Creator</i><br /><i>[6th Jan, 2002] Ascent kills Tunare</i><br /><i>[?] AoD/AL/EL kills Glyphed and Exiled in Ssra</i><br /><i>[18th Feb, 2002] Ascent kills the Arch Lich</i><br /><i>[?] WoW kills Thought Horror Overfiend</i><br /><i>[20th March, 2002] Ascent kills Avatar of War</i><br /><i>[20th March, 2002] Ascent kills The Burrower Beast</i><br />[?] AoD/AL/EL kills Tunare<br /><i>[29th April, 2002] Ascent kills Lord Inquisitor Seru</i><br />[?] DA/EiE kills Tunare<br /><i>[10th May, 2002] Ascent kills the Cursed</i><br /><i>[11th May, 2002] Ascent kills High Priest of Ssra</i><br />[?] Arirang kills the Cursed<br />[?] Avatars of Discord is no more &nbsp;&lt;--- early may 2002?<br /><i>[14th June, 2002] Ascent kills Emperor Ssra</i><br />[?] Bartox, Praetor, Heaton, Thugs, Vayanla and many other AoD/AL members join Ascent<br />[?] Dragon Force is no more<br />[?] Corona moves servers to join Township Rebellion on Stormhammer<br />[?] Glayde, Gylen, Faridan, Alma and a multitude of other Dragon Force members join Ascent<br />[12th July, 2002] Valde Amiticia is no more<br />[12th July, 2002] Hardcores of VA form Shades of Fury, which ends up acting as a purgatory for Anthology<br />[13th July, 2002] Shades of Fury kills Cazic Thule<br /><i>[16th July, 2002] Ascent kills Aten Ha Ra</i><br /><br /><br />[19th July, 2002] Anthology formed, composed mostly of Valde Amicitia members and the AoD members that did not immediately apply to Ascent. Lead by Eelyen with Mdien, Esperonsa and Doraf as other influentials.<br />[14th August, 2002] Anthology kills Tormax<br />[5th Sept, 2002] Ascent and DA/EiE combine forces to kill AoW to deny Arirang (or something). Only co-op between the guilds to date.<br /><br />What DID other guilds do during this time? DA/EiE must have been progressing fairly rapidly, because I remember them being undeniably in the top 3.<br /><br /><br /><b>[29th October, 2002: PLANES OF POWER RELEASED]</b><br /><br /><br />[29th Oct, 2002] DA/EiE kills Emperor Ssra<br /><i>[?] Chauey &lt;Ascent&gt; the first to 65</i><br />[?] Arirang kills Emperor Ssra<br />[7th Nov, 2002] Anthology kills Avatar of War<br />[8th Nov, 2002] DA/EiE kills Aten Ha Ra<br /><i>[9th Nov, 2002] Ascent kills Mithaniel Marr</i><br />[16th Nov, 2002] Anthology kills High Priest of Ssra<br /><i>[22nd Nov, 2002] Ascent kills Bertox</i><br /><i>[23rd Nov, 2002] Ascent kills Agnarr</i><br />[?] Arirang kills AHR<br />[19th Dec, 2002] Anthology kills Cursed<br /><i>[22nd Dec, 2002] Ascent kills Rallos Zek</i><br /><i>[29th Dec, 2002] Ascent kills Solusek Ro</i><br />[30th Dec, 2002] Anthology kills Lord Inquisitor Seru<br />[?] Nashira leaves for the military, Arirang leadership passed on to Achiel<br /><br />[?] Vosh and Llew return to the game, join Reign of Swords<br />[5th Jan, 2003] DA/EiE kills Agnarr<br />[4th Jan, 2003] DA/EiE kills Mith Marr<br />[13th Jan, 2003] DA/EiE kills Bertox<br />[16h Jan, 2003] Anthology kills Emperor Ssra<br /><i>[17th Jan, 2003] Ascent kills Fennin Ro</i><br />[17th Feb, 2003] Anthology kills AHR<br /><i>[28th Feb, 2003] Ascent kills Xegony</i><br />[?] DA/EiE kills RZ<br />[?] Arirang kills RZ<br />[?] Forsaken leads passed to Thoerax<br /><br /><br />[14th April, 2003] Forsaken kills Emperor Ssra<br />[16th April, 2003] DA/EiE kills Fennin<br /><br /><br /><i>[1st May, 2003] Ascent kills Coirnav</i><br />[4th May, 2003] WoW and Anthology merge to create Avatars of Might under Eelyen. &nbsp;Influentials include Zenoflare, Ranax, Karadana, Valcare and Locz<br /><i>[10th May, 2003] Ascent kills Rathe</i><br />[10th May, 2003] Elemental Gods quest finished for Delheru (serverwide first)<br />[?] Avatars of Might name changed to Fires of Time<br />[30th May] DA/EiE kills Xegony<br />[?] Arirang kills Fennin<br />[16th June, 2003] Fires of Time kills Rallos Zek<br />[7th July, 2003] DA/EiE kills Coirnav<br /><i>[27th July, 2003] Ascent kills Quarm</i><br />[4th August, 2003] DA/EiE kills Rathe<br />[14th August. 2003] Forsaken kills Rallos Zek<br />[?] Achiel leaves for the military<br /><br />[10th Sept, 2003] Fires of Time kills Fennin<br />[30th Sept, 2003] Fires of Time kills Xegony<br />[?] Reign of Swords kills RZ<br /><br /><br />[?] Forsaken kills Fennin<br />[?] Reign of Swords splits<br />[6th Oct, 2003] Conviction formed by the other half ok RoS, with Dissonant leading and Vosh and Llew highly influential<br /><br />[27th Oct, 2003] Conviction kills Rallos Zek<br />[24th Nov, 2003] DA/EiE kills Rathe<br />[2nd Dec, 2003] Hegemony kills Rallos Zek<br />[4th Dec, 2003] Forsaken kills Xegony<br />[3rd Jan, 2004] Fires of Time kills Coirnav<br />[4th Jan, 2004] Fires of Time kills Rathe<br />[13th Jan, 2004] Arirang kills Xegony<br /><br /><br /><b>[9th of February, 2004: GATES OF DISCORD RELEASED]</b><br />[9th Feb, 2004] Conviction kills Xegony<br />[17th Feb, 2004] Conviction kills Fennin Ro<br />[1st March, 2004] Forsaken kills Coirnav<br />[8th March, 2004] Forsaken kills Rathe<br /><i>[10th March, 2004] Ascent beats all Ikkinz raids &nbsp;(first day Antechamber stops bugging)</i><br />[16th March, 2004] Reign of Swords kills Xegony<br />[20th March, 2004] DA/EiE beats all Ikkinz raids<br />[25th March, 2004] Reign of Swords kills Fennin Ro<br />[3rd April, 2004] Hegemony kills Fennin Ro<br />[?] Amttee (who had become de facto leader of Arirang) server xfers, and Arirang loses its ability to raid succesfully.<br />[?] Eelyen steps down as Fires of Time leader<br />[?] Kinladar becomes the new leader of FoT<br />[1st May, 2004] Thoerax and Rogosh retire<br />[2nd May, 2004] Forsaken is no more<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><b>FIRSTS BY CLASS and overall</b><br /><b>[BARD]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Asian &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Singer &lt;Bards of Norrath&gt;<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Baelt &lt;Ascent&gt;<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Sethric &lt;Ascent&gt;<br />BotB: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Sethric &lt;Ascent&gt;<br /><br /><b>[BEASTLORD]</b><br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Gamu &lt;Ascent&gt; &nbsp; (Demotts twink)<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Sethu &lt;Ascent&gt; &nbsp;(Sethrics twink)<br /><br /><b>[BERSERKER]</b><br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Thiibledorf &lt;Forsaken&gt;<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Thiibledorf &lt;Forsaken&gt;<br /><br /><b>[CLERIC]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Mirax &lt;Legion of Rodcet Nife&gt;<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Mairi &lt;Arcane Legacy&gt;<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Chauey &lt;Ascent&gt;<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Zamus &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Linskamur &lt;Eastern Keep&gt;<br /><br /><b>[DRUID]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Feylin &lt;Legion of Rodcet Nife&gt;<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Feylin <br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Aellis &lt;Ascent&gt; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Xanatax &lt;Exiled Legion&gt; (Nika?)<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Fenani &lt;Ascent&gt;<br /><br /><b>[ENCHANTER]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Mecholova &lt;Covenant of Peace?&gt;<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Vosh &lt;Exiled Legion&gt;<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Braelyia &lt;Ascent&gt;<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Vosh &lt;Exiled Legion&gt;<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Neckrodeemus &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br /><br /><b>[MAGICIAN]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Amethestos &lt;Luna Imperium&gt;<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Allien<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Neelthak &lt;Ascent&gt; &nbsp;(?)<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Raistonic &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Creath<br /><br /><b>[MONK]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Satao &lt;Covenant of Peace&gt;<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Kimdoohan &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Wwaan &lt;Ascent&gt;<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Kimdoohan &lt;Dol Amroth&gt; (?)<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Adolpho &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br /><br /><b>[NECROMANCER]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Neru &lt;Covenant of Peace&gt;<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Morbos &lt;Exiled Legion&gt; &nbsp;(?)<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Kered &lt;Ascent&gt;<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Tanaya &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Vorczar &lt;Exiled Legion&gt;<br /><br /><b>[PALADIN]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Solstice/Siclaire ??<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Llew &lt;Exiled Legion&gt;<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Quaz &lt;Ascent&gt; <br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Patryn &lt;Arcane Legacy&gt;<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Demott &lt;Altered Destiny&gt;<br /><br /><b>[RANGER]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Shar &lt;Covenant of Peace&gt;<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Eaglesky &lt;Eastern Keep&gt; (Chekota?)<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Korban &lt;Ascent&gt;<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Donal &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Shar &lt;Exiled Legion&gt;<br /><br /><b>[ROGUE]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Fitch &lt;Covenant of Peace&gt;<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Marachai &lt;Exiled Legion&gt;<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Deceitful &lt;Ascent&gt; &nbsp;(Raistonic)<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Marachai &lt;Exiled Legion&gt;<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Ilian &lt;Exiled Legion&gt;<br /><br /><b>[SHADOWKNIGHT]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Nails &lt;Legion of Rodcet Nife&gt;<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Zelgadiss <br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Mallagin/Noruat (??) &lt;Ascent&gt;<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Bagbokk &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Bagbokk &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br /><br /><b>[SHAMAN]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Krishna &lt;Eastern Keep&gt;<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Krishna &lt;Eastern Keep&gt;<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Basar &lt;Ascent&gt;<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Reia &lt;Exiled Legion&gt;<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Krishna &lt;Eastern Keep&gt;<br /><br /><b>[WARRIOR]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Yohon or Rhyno<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Ghime &nbsp; (Arktreod)<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Thun &lt;Ascent&gt;<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Dyvim &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Dyvim &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br /><br /><b>[WIZARD]</b><br />First lvl 50: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Arktreod (Arkmaru) &nbsp;&lt;Covenant of Peace&gt;<br />First lvl 60: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Arkmaru &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br />First lvl 65: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Xanthorian &lt;Ascent&gt; &nbsp;<br />First FA: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Arkmaru &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br />Botb: &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Arkmaru &lt;Avatars of Discord&gt;<br /><br /><br />First Test of Tactics:<br />Dyvim, Blyte, Bagbokk, Tekman, Sethric, Valfarre and Difa<br /><br />Second Test of Tactics:<br />Delheru, Thun, Honch, Adres, Wildas, Mallagin, Tyal<br /><br />Third Test of Tactics:<br />Delheru, Winnikin, Lighting, Honch, Thun, Adres, Reia, Mallagin, Tyal.... uh. 18 people.<br />
