						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7666#msg7666"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7666#msg7666">Re:RN History</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> May 04, 2004, 03:45:12 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Gozzrim is &quot;the other dude in there&quot; for WToV.<br /><br />Thought there would be more about the NToV wars and killing Aary = right to farm wing stuff.<br /><br />Didnt WoW have first 10th ring war win?<br /><br />Think the PoS clear was folks under the guildtag MythMakers<br /><br />==============<br /><br />WoW and Anthology merged to make Avatars of Might (temp guild name) May 4th, 03 under Eelyen. &nbsp;Influentials would include Eelyen, Zenoflare, Ranax, Karadana, Valcare and Locz (as I recall)<br />==================<br /><br />You could probably get some good solid dates by browsing guild boards and/or defunct guildboards for posts with dates on em.
						</td>
					</tr>
