								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7668#msg7668">Re:RN History</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #4 on:</b> May 04, 2004, 03:53:58 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I don&#039;t have all day tho :P &nbsp;If the guilds could provide the dates and people provide stuff they find interesting, it&#039;d be more interesting. Went through part of our dkp for the hell of it to get some dates from there.<br /><br />And no, WoW most definitely did not win first Ring War. I think we did the first 15 or so.<br /><br /><br /><br />And the NToV disputes... Well, Ascent never was actually involved except one Eashen of the Sky which &quot;EK almost got&quot; looking at our dkp. It was mostly AoD vs someone... think they ran over DA/EiE or something, or was it DF at Aary lair?
						</td>
					</tr>
