						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7670#msg7670"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7670#msg7670">Re:RN History</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #5 on:</b> May 04, 2004, 04:28:07 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Here&#039;s some release dates per Gamespot if you care for the Timeline:<br /><br />Everquest: Feb 28, 1999<br />RoK: Mar 31, 2000<br />SoV: Dec 4, 2000<br />SoL: Dec 2, 2001<br />PoP: Oct 28, 2002<br />LoY: Mar 4, 2003<br />LDoN: Sep 8, 2003<br />GoD: Feb 9, 2004<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
