	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7671"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b>Eelyen</b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guest<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								<a href="mailto:"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7671#msg7671"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7671#msg7671">Re:RN History</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> May 04, 2004, 04:33:59 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Ok, found my old Anthology dkp excel sheet. &nbsp;Will try to reconstruct as best I can.<br /><br />[Dec 99/Jan 00] Ancient Souls was formed somewhere around Dec 99/Jan 00 I believe. &nbsp;Key people Dundanoor (leader), Eelyen, Taeran, Locz, some others I think.<br /><br />[Jan 00/Feb 00] Eelyen becomes leader of Ancient Souls<br />[Feb 01/Mar 01] Eelyen leaves Ancient Souls for AoD, week leader AS disbands.<br /><br />Now for Anthology, I had my long talk with Bartox on July 17th, 2002 and Anthology&#039;s first recorded raid was on July 21st, 2002. &nbsp;I believe we formed it on a friday though, which would put it&#039;s formation on July 19th, 2002. &nbsp;Key people if I remember correct. &nbsp;Eelyen, Mdien, Esperonsa, Doraf<br /><br />Now for some kills, not including all fk, just some semi-relavent ones and the big ones.<br /><br />[22nd July, 2002] Anthology kills Vindicator<br />[22nd July, 2002] Anthology kills Statue<br />[28th July, 2002] Anthology kills Cazic Thule<br />[30th, July, 2002] Anthology kills Sontalak<br />[2nd August, 2002] Anthology kills Dain<br />[14th August, 2002] Anthology kills Tormax<br />[12th Sept, 2002] Anthology kills Zlexak with 38 people<br />[30th Sept, 2002] Anthology kills Lord Vyemm<br />[7th Nov, 2002] Anthology kills Avatar of War<br />[16th Nov, 2002] Anthology kills High Priest<br />[17th Nov, 2002] Anthology kills Shei<br />[4th Dec, 2002] Anthology kills Blood of Ssra<br />[19th Dec, 2002] Anthology kills Cursed (Eelyen recieves disgruntled tell from EiE/DA member claiming Anthology would never see Emperor)<br /><br />[30th Dec, 2002] Anthology kills Lord Seru (Server 2nd)<br />[13th Jan, 2003] Anthology clears Ring of Vulak (Server 2nd)<br /><br />[16th Jan, 2003] Anthology kills Emperor<br />[17th Feb, 2003] Anthology clears Vex Thal (7:30am AHR kill)<br /><br />[4th May, 2003] Anthology / Warlords of Wrath merge to become Fires of Time (Merged under Avatars of Might for time name)<br /><br />[16th June, 2003] Fires of Time kills Rallos Zek<br /><br />[10th Sept, 2003] Fires of Time kills Fennin<br />[30th Sept, 2003] Fires of Time kills Xegony<br /><br />[3rd Jan, 2004] Fires of Time kills Cornaiv<br />[4th Jan, 2004] Fires of Time kills Rathe<br /><br />[20th Feb, 2004] Fires of Time kills Vallon Zek and enters Phase 5<br />[24th Mar, 2004] Fires of Time kills Innoruuk and faces Quarm<br /><br />Quarm kill pending.<br /><br />Bout all I got atm, add whatever.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
