								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7672#msg7672">Re:RN History</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #7 on:</b> May 04, 2004, 04:50:42 pm &#187;</span></td>
