								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Delheru link=board=1;threadid=813;start=0#msg7662 date=1083696752</div><div class="quote">[?] HoS splits due to playtimes or whatever. What is now HoS is clearly dominated by asian players. Valdraug, Gazloy etc leading figures.<br />[?] Dol Amroth is formed by the Americans from HoS, with Vyel, Nujai, Phad, Thecklos etc as key figures (?)<br />&nbsp;</div><br /><br />Slight correction DA was the merger of the North American HoS people and the raid level peeps from the Darkflame Knights (DFK - Nujai et al), the remaining DFK being transformed into a roleplay/casual guild.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
