									&#171; <i>Last Edit: May 04, 2004, 05:19:30 pm by Yizaar</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Wicc Vanwinkle, Arch Convoker<br />Dragon&#039;s Fist Mage Officer
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
