								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7674#msg7674">Re:RN History</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> May 04, 2004, 05:20:36 pm &#187;</span></td>
