								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<br />Couple of things Del...<br /><br />RN cranked up around April 23rd of 1999 I think... Phad was created May 22, 1999 a little less than a month after the server went live. <br /><br /> Also I did not join DA until several weeks after it had formed so I am not in any way a founding member. &nbsp;Vyel, Nujai and Qadan were clearly the early driving forces behind DA though I do not remember the other officers.<br /><br />Phad
						</td>
