							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Phad link=board=1;threadid=813;start=0#msg7674 date=1083705636</div><div class="quote"><br />Couple of things Del...<br /><br />RN cranked up around April 23rd of 1999 I think... Phad was created May 22, 1999 a little less than a month after the server went live. <br /><br />&nbsp;Also I did not join DA until several weeks after it had formed so I am not in any way a founding member. &nbsp;Vyel, Nujai and Qadan were clearly the early driving forces behind DA though I do not remember the other officers.<br /><br />Phad<br /></div><br />When DA first formed, there were a few officers, i think like 6 of the founding 10 were officers, maybe even 7<br /><br />Nujai and Vyel as Guildleaders for the most part<br />Qadan as raid leader<br />Aaeladvenya was the treasurer<br />Faludir was the PR and Recruit guy<br />Filja i&#039;m sure was an officer, tho i forgot what he was an officer of :P<br />Quatto, dunno if he was an officer or not but he was the webpage guy<br /><br />Don&#039;t remember much back then, all i know is that after we formed, within 2 weeks we had a huge exodus from Order of Dragon? with katana and muffin, darin, phad i think? a few others &lt;bashem, temil?&gt;<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
