								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7680#msg7680">Re:History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> May 04, 2004, 08:23:14 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Thanks for the input.<br /><br />Major missing stuff that I can&#039;t easily get is the very early kills. Also Forsaken, RoS, UoP, Arirang and more detailed Conviction kills would be interesting to have.<br /><br /><br />Also the date of that DA/EiE co-op. Like someone said, it was fairly important back when.<br /><br />Just stuff like that if you happen to remember or have access to dkp or whatever.
