									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7683#msg7683">Re:History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #13 on:</b> May 04, 2004, 10:46:19 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Order of the Dragon was a very under-rated guild. &nbsp;Alot of good players came from OOD. &nbsp;Some of them Bashem, Creath, Phad, Maple (sewerslop), Muffin, Heclrolv, Korban, Dendee, Pepa, Ashani, Tilien, Katia, Krystia, Elendar, Seela, Helnero, Eldog.. many more im forgetting if you remember any let me know.<br /><br />Melissa<br />Ascent
